        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Area</strong> three 5-foot bursts that don't overlap</p><hr /><p>You conjure three deadly clusters of flesh-devouring fungi. Whenever a creature starts its turn in one of the clusters or the first time a creature enters a cluster each round, it takes 3d4 poison damage with a Fortitude save as poisonous spores fill the air. Corpses within a cluster rapidly decompose.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes half damage and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full damage and becomes sickened 1.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target takes double damage and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 2}.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4.</p>"
